OL,3,GNEWSACrypto thieves attack man in home
OL,4,Aand threaten to kill pregnant wife's
OL,5,Ababy in 'horrific' robbery
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains
OL,8,Fdistressing details
OL,10,FA businessman was beaten with hammers
OL,11,Fby masked men who broke into his home
OL,12,Fand threatened to kill his heavily
OL,13,Fpregnant wife unless he transferred
OL,14,Fhundreds of thousands of pounds of
OL,15,Fcryptocurrency.
OL,17,FSpeaking to the BBC, the couple, who
OL,18,Fwant to remain anonymous, described the
OL,19,Fattack as "horrific" and said they
OL,20,Ffeared for their unborn baby's life.
